# Agent Policy Registry

- Read `docs-governance/canonical/AGENT_POLICY_REGISTRY.md`, `docs-governance/canonical/AGENT_BEHAVIOR_SPEC_V1.md`, `docs-governance/canonical/CLASSIFICATION_GOVERNANCE_SPEC_V1.md`, and `docs-governance/canonical/SAFE_MODE_CONTRACT.md` before changing agent behavior architecture.
- Every agent change must declare jurisdiction, allowed entities, allowed actions, and escalation/refusal behavior.
- Safe Mode is a runtime contract, not a soft prompt instruction.
- No agent may be treated as universally capable by default.
